    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "fyq1m",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 20309,
      "name": "Popover variants note",
      "width": 320,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "Compact project popover — 320px wide, all blocks stretch to the card width.\n\n• Title is clamped to 2 lines, overflow is cut with an ellipsis.\n• Description is capped at 500 characters, wraps freely.\n• Author section: \"Author\" label + team size on top, avatar and author name below.\n• \"I'm there\" section (role + period) is rendered only in a user context (Talent Card). Without user data the card ends after the author section.\n• Sections are split by hairlines — no boxes, no fills.\n• Badges (status · genre · platform) wrap onto extra rows when they don't fit one line; a single badge wider than the card truncates its label with an ellipsis.\n• No equity, cap table, files, investors or other author/scout-only data.\n\nSee \"Popover — Project (long content)\" for the worst-case layout."
    },
