              "fill": "#52525B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "A hand-painted underwater adventure about a lighthouse keeper who returns to the sunken town of Marrow Bay and uncovers its stories through tides, light and the debris of everyday lives. It mixes point-and-click exploration with a living tide system that reshapes every district twice per in-game day, so puzzles, routes and conversations change depending on when you arrive. A solo founder plus a small art team, working towards a vertical slice and looking for a publishing partner.",
