            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "vzEKb",
              "name": "Generated from src/confi",
              "fill": "#76756F",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Generated from src/config/design/ — tokens.ts (primitives), roles.ts (modes and densities), css.ts (the --gd-* names). Each row carries the CSS custom property you type in SCSS, the TS accessor, and the literal value. This document's variables were migrated to these same values on 2026-08-05, so a screen bound to $text-primary or $font now renders what ships; the swatches here stay literal so the sheet keeps showing the real hex even if a variable drifts.",
              "lineHeight": 1.55,
              "fontFamily": "Onest",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "PN1rE",
          "name": "Section — Neutral ramp",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#FFFFFF",
          "cornerRadius": 16,
          "stroke": "#EBEAE8",
