                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "letterSpacing": 1.2
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "WECN0",
                  "name": "--gd-neutral-<step>  ·  ",
                  "fill": "#76756F",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "--gd-neutral-<step>  ·  neutral[step] in tokens.ts. Constant hue around 40°, chroma tapering into the darks. This is the only grey ramp — the audit found 20+ ad-hoc greys and they all collapse into these thirteen.",
