                      "id": "gPZoV",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "There is no combat. The pressure comes from fuel, from weather in the field, and from the fact that the station's other residents remember what you promised them last week.",
