                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "zeiuI",
                  "name": "Body",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Nebula Drift is a single-player salvage sim set in the debris field of a war nobody won. You fly a tug with a bad engine and a good winch, and everything you tow back becomes part of the station you live on — a room, a workshop, or a wall you would rather not look at.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "H9CGI",
                  "name": "Body 2",
                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "There is no combat. The pressure comes from fuel, from weather in the field, and from the fact that the station's other residents remember what you promised them last week.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
