    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "BZIa7",
      "x": -420,
      "y": 44957,
      "name": "Row — Admin — Audit log",
      "width": 300,
      "height": 320,
      "content": "Admin — Audit log\n\nAdmin audit trail: who changed what and when. To the right: the entry detail modal, the column legend, the filters popover and the open event-type select.\n\nThe table answers when / who / what was touched / what changed — no JSON in the grid. Raw payloads live in the detail modal only.\n\nEntity type sits under the target name, matching the secondary line in WHEN and ACTOR. Failed rows carry an error tint. Times show the zone in the column header.\n\nPersonal fields are recorded by name only, never by value — the row for a Profile edit shows the field chips and \"values not stored\"."
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "mfg5I",
      "x": 2999,
      "y": 1184,
      "name": "Scout Cabinet — states",
      "clip": true,
      "width": 420,
      "fill": "#FAFAF9",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 28,
      "padding": 32,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "bnLVS",
          "name": "T",
          "fill": "#1A1917",
          "content": "Scout Cabinet — sidebar states",
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "pIKUY",
          "name": "D",
          "fill": "#5A5955",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "One card at the top of the hub sidebar, rendered only for a user who has a ScoutCabinet. Which body it shows is decided in this order: saved searches first, then fresh projects by cabinet focus, then the empty focus prompt. The state in the sidebar frame is the middle one.",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "iq5jw",
          "name": "A · FRESH PROJECTS (IN THE SIDEBAR FRAME)",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 10,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "fV6oa",
              "name": "L",
              "fill": "#1A1917",
              "content": "A · FRESH PROJECTS (IN THE SIDEBAR FRAME)",
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 0.6
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "XwTDs",
              "name": "N",
              "fill": "#76756F",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Cabinet focus — platforms, genres, stages — turned into a query over projects created in the last 30 days, newest first, 5 rows. This is the state a scout sees before they have saved anything. The age sits last in the meta line so the genre and stage read first; a row opens the project page.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "tmI0i",
          "name": "B · SAVED SEARCHES (WINS WHEN THERE ARE ANY)",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 10,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "sQIhO",
              "name": "L",
              "fill": "#1A1917",
              "content": "B · SAVED SEARCHES (WINS WHEN THERE ARE ANY)",
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 0.6
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "xTiUS",
              "name": "N",
              "fill": "#76756F",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "A saved search is the scout stating what they want in their own words, so it outranks the focus-derived list. The badge is how many projects matched it this month, not the total — the total is on the games table behind the row. Neutral badge, not brand tint: these are things to browse, and the brand tint in this sidebar is reserved for what is waiting on an answer. Up to 5 rows, ordered by new matches.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
