                      "id": "n6kM12",
                      "name": "footnote",
                      "fill": "$text-tertiary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Every title is a link to the item's public page — ink at rest, underlined and in --gd-color-link on hover, with a focus ring when tabbed to. One line, truncated, full value in a tooltip. Switching type keeps the table at ten rows, so the panel height never jumps. A dash means the platform has no value; a zero means it counted none.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
