    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "HTIIG",
      "x": 15235,
      "y": 46500,
      "name": "Advisor — project popover note",
      "width": 320,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "Project → popover\n\nEvery project mention in the advisor space opens the compact project popover on hover / tap:\n\n• \"Modal — Advice request\" → the PROJECT row (cover + name).\n• \"Advisor — Requests\" → the project line on a request card.\n• \"Advisor — Projects\" and \"Advisor — Reviews\" → the project cell / card title.\n\nUse \"Popover — Project (no user link)\" — the variant WITHOUT the \"I'm there\" block: that section belongs to a user context (Talent Card), and an advisor is not on the team.\n\n\"Open project\" inside the popover and on the modal row still leads to the full project page."
    },
