      "name": "Row — Chat · redesign",
      "width": 300,
      "height": 360,
      "content": "Chat · redesign (GDHUB-62)\n\nFloating Messages panel (520×720) anchored under the header chat icon, replacing the right Drawer. List and conversation are two views of one panel; the back arrow returns to the list. Below 768px the panel is full-screen.\n\nExpanded (larger) mode is deferred — no expand button.\n\nIcons are drawn with lucide stand-ins; every icon node is named after its @tabler/icons-react component.\n\nSpec: docs/design/specs/chat-redesign.md"
