          "type": "text",
          "id": "yXgF4",
          "name": "Notes",
          "fill": "$text-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "One slot per day of the sprint. A beat = team activity that day (devlog, artifact, task done, pulse link); peak height 1–3 by the number of people. Days so far are one red trace, days ahead stay grey; a sprint with no activity at all is a grey flat line. A new beat plays once. Static under prefers-reduced-motion.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
